### 變數
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/v1
@apiKey = 48c7fdb6b6f257f26f543aae0c5fd8e2424a32af15eb4d55bcc9cb3158cfe2c7

### 0. 健康檢查: 查目前設定
GET {{baseUrl}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ===== 第一階段: 只建立 peg =====

### 1. 建立 peg entity
# @name createPegEntity
POST {{baseUrl}}/entities
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "peg"}

### 2. 建立 blue instance(4 張樣本)
# @name createPegBlue
POST {{baseUrl}}/entities/{{createPegEntity.response.body.$.id}}/instances
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

blue
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="peg_blue_1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/peg_blue_1.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="peg_blue_2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/peg_blue_2.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="peg_blue_3.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/peg_blue_3.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="peg_blue_4.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/peg_blue_4.jpg
------boundary--

### 3. 建立 purple instance(4 張樣本)
# @name createPegPurple
POST {{baseUrl}}/entities/{{createPegEntity.response.body.$.id}}/instances
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

purple
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="peg_purple_1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/peg_purple_1.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="peg_purple_2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/peg_purple_2.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="peg_purple_3.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/peg_purple_3.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="peg_purple_4.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/peg_purple_4.jpg
------boundary--

### 4. 確認 peg entity 底下有 2 個 instance
GET {{baseUrl}}/entities/{{createPegEntity.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 5. 辨識 scene_1(第一次)—— 理論上: peg(blue/purple)抓得到, 瓶蓋/硬幣/卡片/紙盒都應該是 unknown
# @name recognizeScene1First
POST {{baseUrl}}/recognize
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="scene_1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/scene_1.jpg
------boundary--

### 6. 查剛剛那次辨識寫進 predictions 的紀錄
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions?status=pending_review
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ===== 第二階段: 加入 bottle_cap, 不重啟服務 =====

### 7. 建立 bottle_cap entity
# @name createCapEntity
POST {{baseUrl}}/entities
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "bottle_cap"}

### 8. 建立 green instance(2 張樣本)
POST {{baseUrl}}/entities/{{createCapEntity.response.body.$.id}}/instances
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

