### 11. 辨識同一張 scene_1(第二次)—— 理論上: peg 一樣抓得到, 瓶蓋這次也該抓到了, 硬幣/卡片/紙盒依然 unknown
# @name recognizeScene1Second
POST {{baseUrl}}/recognize
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="scene_1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/scene_1.jpg
------boundary--

### 12. 換一張角度不同的 scene_2 再測一次, 交叉驗證同一批 instance 對不同拍攝角度的泛化
POST {{baseUrl}}/recognize
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="scene_2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/scene_2.jpg
------boundary--

### 13. 查全部 predictions, 應該有兩輪 scene_1 + 一輪 scene_2 的紀錄
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}



### 修正 peg_purple_1(sample id=5)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/samples/5
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bbox": [800.0, 1920.0, 2125.0, 2550.0]}

### 修正 peg_purple_2(sample id=6)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/samples/6
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bbox": [600.0, 1460.0, 2170.0, 2875.0]}